800
01:09:00.865 --> 01:09:02.264
No. No!

801
01:09:02.266 --> 01:09:04.702
No. No. No. No.

802
01:09:05.169 --> 01:09:06.672
No!

803
01:09:11.642 --> 01:09:14.145
No!

804
01:09:14.546 --> 01:09:16.147
