811
01:12:30.141 --> 01:12:32.011
Where is Sophia?

812
01:12:34.178 --> 01:12:36.011
You two are friends?

813
01:12:36.013 --> 01:12:37.880
Tell me where she is!

814
01:12:37.882 --> 01:12:39.881
We change your hall
assignments on each level

815
