872
01:20:31.721 --> 01:20:34.225
I'll take my chances.

873
01:20:40.330 --> 01:20:41.897
Come with me.

874
01:20:41.899 --> 01:20:43.331
We'll get out.
We'll get help...

875
01:20:43.333 --> 01:20:45.466
